# Ω-Math v1.0 research-layer example
# The syntax below uses only the current reference surface.
# Research metadata is documented externally by V1.0_RESEARCH_PROTOCOL.md.

entity A 0
entity B 1
entity C 0

relation A B +1 rAB
relation B C -1 rBC
relation C A +1 rCA

path P = A->B->C
path Q = A->B->C

path_eq P Q
sign P
cycle P
dist A B
